WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.258
Google built a

00:00:01.069 --> 00:00:02.048
fake internet to

00:00:01.859 --> 00:00:02.956
train its AI

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:03.557
agents

00:00:04.086 --> 00:00:05.111
Chrome's team is

00:00:04.923 --> 00:00:06.279
building AI browsing

00:00:06.091 --> 00:00:07.411
features with Gemini

00:00:07.588 --> 00:00:08.295
and needed a

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:09.109
safe place to

00:00:08.921 --> 00:00:10.170
train agents that

00:00:09.982 --> 00:00:10.972
browse the real

00:00:10.784 --> 00:00:11.326
web

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:12.655
So they built

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:13.552
the Mirror Dimension

00:00:13.729 --> 00:00:15.167
an isolated alternate

00:00:14.979 --> 00:00:16.158
internet with social

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:16.571
media

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:18.021
shopping and bank

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:19.224
dashboards they fully

00:00:19.036 --> 00:00:19.802
control

00:00:20.342 --> 00:00:21.733
Agents complete tasks

00:00:21.545 --> 00:00:22.523
there and face

00:00:22.335 --> 00:00:23.714
resilience tests like

00:00:23.526 --> 00:00:24.976
hidden prompt injections

00:00:25.094 --> 00:00:26.332
without ever touching

00:00:26.144 --> 00:00:27.193
the open internet

00:00:27.726 --> 00:00:28.740
Full story on

00:00:28.551 --> 00:00:29.447
the dashboard
